'''Catclaw Dojo''' (ネコ道場, ''Neko Dōjō'', '''Cat Dojo''') is a game mode unlocked upon clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1. The Dojo consists of levels with an invincible base that delivers nearly unsurvivable damage and constantly spawning enemies, with a time limit. There is a score to these levels, which increases only through defeating enemies. The level ends once the enemies take down the [[Cat Base]] or time runs out, whichever comes first.

The Dojo is found beside [[Empire of Cats]], [[Into the Future]] and [[Cats of the Cosmos]] and [[Legend Stages]] from the [[Main Menu]].

[[File:6.2 New Screen.jpg|thumb|right|300px|Inside the Dojo]]

==About Dojo Battles==
You have a time limit to defeat as many enemies as possible. The game supplies you with unlimited [[Battle Items#Speed Up|Speed Up]]s, triple Speed Ups (which cost normal Speed Ups if the [[Battle Cats Officers' Club|Officers' Club]] Gold Pass is not active), and [[Battle Items#Cat CPU|Cat CPU]]s; however, you cannot use other items. The base has unlimited health and attacks Cats under a certain range. You gain no money for defeating enemies.

==New Enemies==
*[[Dummy (Enemy Base)|Dummy]] - An animated enemy base appearing in [[Wanderer's Trial (Stage 1)|Wanderer's Trial]] and the [[Ranking Dojo]].
*[[Niconico TV (Enemy Base)|Niconico TV]] - An animated enemy base appearing in [[Nico Training Yawame]].
*[[W (form 1)|W]] (form 1) - An enemy with three different variants. It is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy.
*[[W (form 2)|W]] (form 2) - An enemy with three different variants. It is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy.
*[[W (form 3)|W]] (form 3) - An enemy with three different variants. It is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy.

